  "question": {
    "text": "If the roots of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are in arithmetic progression, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math> satisfy the relation"
